WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:05.840
Rescue workers in Morocco have been working&nbsp;
tirelessly for days to save a five-year-old boy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.920
who fell into a well. Crowds have&nbsp;
flocked to the village of Ighran to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:13.120
cheer on the rescuers. Officials&nbsp;
say they are getting close to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:17.040
boy - but that conditions are dangerous&nbsp;
and the rescue is in a challenging phase.&nbsp;

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:24.080
Throngs of people watch as rescuers race&nbsp;
to save a boy's life. Little Rayan has been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:33.120
stuck 32 meters down this well since Tuesday.
"He was playing until the middle of the day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:38.560
He was with me at first, but then I&nbsp;
looked for him and couldn't find him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:46.080
After searching we realized that he fell&nbsp;
into the well. Now we are praying to God."&nbsp;

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:54.960
At less than half a meter wide, the well is&nbsp;
too narrow to pull the boy out. Rescuers use&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:59.840
ropes to lower oxygen and water as well as a&nbsp;
closed-circuit camera to check on his health.&nbsp;

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:05.680
On Thursday, a rescuer was&nbsp;
able to go down a parallel hole&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:07.840
that had been dug to get closer to Rayan.&nbsp;

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:14.240
"I managed to communicate with the&nbsp;
child and asked if he could hear me.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:21.280
There was a response. I waited for a minute&nbsp;
and saw that he began using the oxygen."&nbsp;

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:27.760
Once rescuers were able to dig down to the depth&nbsp;
where Rayan is stuck, they began excavating a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:33.440
horizontal tunnel to try and reach the boy.
But the loose soil has slowed their efforts.&nbsp;

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:40.080
Gripped by the boy's terrifying plight,&nbsp;
many have come to cheer on the rescuers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:45.040
or even to volunteer. But authorities have&nbsp;
asked them to stand back and let them work.&nbsp;

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:50.160
"Many people from the region&nbsp;
came to the site of the accident&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:55.360
and some even spent the night there. Little Rayan&nbsp;
touched them and everyone is praying for him."&nbsp;

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:02.960
Officials said on Friday that they were&nbsp;
just meters away from reaching Rayan.&nbsp;

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:07.840
A police helicopter is waiting to take him&nbsp;
to the hospital as soon as he is freed.

